<p>Okay. So you have to be a graduate in Chemistry to understand this skip…</p>
</blockquote>
<p>I am, to my eternal shame, only a High School graduate (and that but barely).</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;show&nbsp;block</a></div>
